Clean Rabbick was added as a monster generated by Rabbick, both in '''Beta 30.0'''. It's a 1/1/1 effectless monster of which one would be summoned by a Rabbick's Turbo and Dust (making the cost not mean anything under normal conditions).

'''Beta 36.1''' buffed both by making Rabbick's Turbo add this to your hand instead, while this card itself got its cost reduced from 1G to 0G, making it still a free monster. The player can now just decide if they want to summon it right away, and where. (Rabbick's Dust stayed the same.)

